{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06Q1", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "TEXTBFCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTBFOPEN_0001": "{\\bf "}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4f1d965ee85f9caabdfbad910b4520895923c38ceddc7efdbc92419ae381fcf3", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nNote that a morphism of finite presentation is <TEXTBFOPEN_0001>not<TEXTBFCLOSE_0001> just a quasi-compact\nmorphism which is locally of finite presentation.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9e23430c8b9340f41f769c799600e4eb00c90ab589d7fc9c0c71befb1edd153d", "unit_id": "tag:06Q1:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06Q1", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-finite-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8e6e31b53a58e2d673e7cb958ff35be3ac8f6041700d90b4dcf99044388f24b5", "source_text": "The composition of finitely presented morphisms is of finite presentation.\nThe same holds for morphisms which are locally of finite presentation.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:dc2dbc34d07bbdff7c34373aeb0dedbdfb375ad4ecd5f116633e908fc71af5f8", "unit_id": "tag:06Q3:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06Q1", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{remark-composition}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-composition-finite-presentation}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:510ad73fc7579492aaa58bd04564efd4b7d674016e936beb6c51b31706740e88", "source_text": "Combine\nRemark <REF_0001>\nwith\nMorphisms of Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:42baeeddfdc787ab470dd719cdf469251f2189c9f03332d9d393a22180b42f4a", "unit_id": "tag:06Q3:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06Q1", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-finite-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4a6cf465f90e51029ec51eea20bbea3eb897ee338b1f59754f435de9a6f18a1e", "source_text": "A base change of a finitely presented morphism is of finite presentation.\nThe same holds for morphisms which are locally of finite presentation.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0dcda06aca7f83ddf032ab538adf105202922c5fd94af068a703557e4ad8bc54", "unit_id": "tag:06Q4:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06Q1", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{remark-base-change}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-base-change-finite-presentation}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f86b372e2e4c62a74608ca11088bae4473910274a116a88362d0bce18ee86a9b", "source_text": "Combine\nRemark <REF_0001>\nwith\nMorphisms of Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:42baeeddfdc787ab470dd719cdf469251f2189c9f03332d9d393a22180b42f4a", "unit_id": "tag:06Q4:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06Q1", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-presentation-finite-type}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e3efcf950581efe7536f0a331861f6d116bbe1211ae155cad5276f2ce6dc6d92", "source_text": "A morphism which is locally of finite presentation is locally of finite type.\nA morphism of finite presentation is of finite type.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:92df17b1f929423d789954b1427ef46ce17eb80205bc17747f44a7084dc1c0e5", "unit_id": "tag:06Q5:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06Q1", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{remark-implication}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-finite-presentation-finite-type}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:acd20314139464c1f001089461ecd6fe1aa2f08c5a0d81cbf2c82e93b103d82b", "source_text": "Combine\nRemark <REF_0001>\nwith\nMorphisms of Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:42baeeddfdc787ab470dd719cdf469251f2189c9f03332d9d393a22180b42f4a", "unit_id": "tag:06Q5:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06Q1", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0006": "$f$", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-noetherian-finite-type-finite-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d71d97dbda4f9f1ac951bd93f0d8770cde6b8df3fc41a69d01afe0883c2fe40f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0f227b3ebce85b6982502a80ddca700ac2bf950e2f4617dabd636978536394cd", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> If <MATH_0002> is locally Noetherian and <MATH_0003> locally of finite type\nthen <MATH_0004> is locally of finite presentation.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0005> is locally Noetherian and <MATH_0006> of finite type and\nquasi-separated then <MATH_0007> is of finite presentation.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:84c777578243786b389b4a9db36c5d73ed4c5e3c2858865f4b8054cd7e71c725", "unit_id": "tag:0DQJ:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06Q1", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$h$", "MATH_0004": "$a$", "MATH_0005": "$h$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-local-source-target}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-noetherian-finite-type-finite-presentation}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:162c36145879d49c18edc7b8f42e05b9fc5e5964c514d671e30d592555c5e0bf", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bab8b5bde8b85baa2418facc20e63e626bfba26d368f8837a1029fdae29a9835", "source_text": "Assume <MATH_0001>\nlocally of finite type and <MATH_0002> locally Noetherian.\nThis means there exists a diagram as in\nLemma <REF_0001>\nwith <MATH_0003> locally of finite type and surjective vertical arrow <MATH_0004>. By\nMorphisms of Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0002>\n<MATH_0005> is locally of finite presentation.\nHence <MATH_0006>\nis locally of finite presentation by definition.\nThis proves (1).\nIf <MATH_0007> is of finite type and quasi-separated then it is also\nquasi-compact and quasi-separated and (2) follows immediately.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5aff1db70f895297522f285179d8fa14e697daf232d243c3e3459287f297ea0b", "unit_id": "tag:0DQJ:proof"}
